+`hupiCheers` sometimes after a right answer. TTS may say "Hupi" like "Buti": check on the tablet.
+Tracing game (`DrawScreen`): two rounds per letter/number. Round 1 as before (outline + stroke guides); round 2
+`TracePad(dotted = true)` hides the outline and draws each stroke as dots with arrowheads (`drawDottedStroke`),
+numbers and the guide dot stay. Stars fill half per round; the letter counts (star, fanfare, demo) after round 2.
+The story's Trace step still uses one round.
+
 To do / to check with the owner:
 1. Owner to play the story with a child and report pace, humour and difficulty.
 2. Owner to listen to all animal sounds and check the tracing arrows on letters like a, g, 5, 8.
